WEBVTT

01:46:09.802 --> 01:46:11.803
Emperor.

01:46:11.804 --> 01:46:14.890
We believed contact would
be made if help was required.

01:46:14.891 --> 01:46:18.435
We could not
contact you without hair.

01:46:18.436 --> 01:46:21.022
Yes, we know.

01:46:21.606 --> 01:46:22.940
We feel remorse.

01:46:23.441 --> 01:46:25.026
There was nothing we could do.

01:46:25.735 --> 01:46:27.569
We all feel remorse.

01:46:27.570 --> 01:46:29.781
That's over now.

01:46:30.740 --> 01:46:32.533
Inform us of the experiments

01:46:33.576 --> 01:46:35.453
on the human subjects.

01:46:36.287 --> 01:46:38.664
The experiments
have nearly all failed.

01:46:38.873 --> 01:46:41.959
There are only two
human subjects remaining

01:46:42.752 --> 01:46:44.712
and the likelihood
of success

01:46:45.254 --> 01:46:46.881
is zero.

01:46:47.423 --> 01:46:49.342
Because of who they are.

01:46:49.759 --> 01:46:53.638
A decision
has to be made.

01:47:04.440 --> 01:47:06.526
We believe

01:47:06.901 --> 01:47:08.736
that it is over.

01:47:09.362 --> 01:47:11.197
They have had their time.

01:47:11.948 --> 01:47:14.158
And in their time
they have imperiled

01:47:14.909 --> 01:47:17.370
the life they share.

01:47:18.079 --> 01:47:20.080
And so we have decided

01:47:20.081 --> 01:47:22.625
their time will end.
